== thirds ==
1|3 + 1|3 + 1|3 = 1|1
as real:          1

== tenths ==
1|10 + 2|10 = 3|10
as real:      0.30000000000000004

== lowest terms, always ==
6|8   is 3|4
100|4 is 25|1
3|1   is 3|1

== a harmonic sum, exactly ==
1 + 1|2 + ... + 1|8 = 761|280
and as a real:        2.717857142857143

== raising to a power stays exact ==
(1|2) ^ 3  is 1|8
(2|3) ^ 2  is 4|9
(3|1) ^ -1 is 1|3
as a real:    0.3333333333333333

== an integer widens to a fraction on its own ==
3 as a fraction is 3|1
3 + 1|2 is         7|2
